<h3 class="display log-title" style="margin:18px 0 0;font-size:28px;line-height:1.15">Find Your Bearings</h3>
<p style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#2E3842">Free, and also the first stage of the full journey. A short game for your imagination: you picture a few things, one after the other, and only afterwards find out what they might be telling you. It takes about five minutes. It tends to stay with people a lot longer.</p>
<a class="hand" href="#bearings" style="display:inline-flex;margin-top:6px;font-size:21px;line-height:1.3;color:#8A5129;min-height:44px;align-items:center">Get it in your inbox, below →</a>
</div>

<div data-show="1" hidden>
<div class="log-head" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:4px 18px;margin-top:14px;font-size:13px;color:#4A5560;line-height:1.5">
<span>Position <span class="hand" style="font-size:18px;color:#1C4F6B">N 01°</span></span>
<span>Weather <span class="hand" style="font-size:18px;color:#1C4F6B">fog lifting</span></span>
<span>Lessons <span class="hand" style="font-size:18px;color:#1C4F6B">1 to 6</span></span>
</div>
<h3 class="display log-title" style="margin:18px 0 0;font-size:28px;line-height:1.15">Wake Up the Inner Navigator</h3>
<p style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#2E3842">First, notice where you actually are. Before planning the next destination, get curious about who's doing the navigating: your patterns, your inner dialogue, what brings you joy, the assumptions quietly steering your everyday choices. Because the voice in your head isn't always the voice of wisdom. Sometimes it's just your downstairs neighbour.</p>
<p class="hand" style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;color:#8A5129">Note to self: the neighbour has opinions.</p>
<p style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#4A5560">[Lesson titles 1–6, TBD]</p>
</div>

<div data-show="2" hidden>
<div class="log-head" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:4px 18px;margin-top:14px;font-size:13px;color:#4A5560;line-height:1.5">
<span>Position <span class="hand" style="font-size:18px;color:#1C4F6B">N 02°</span></span>
<span>Weather <span class="hand" style="font-size:18px;color:#1C4F6B">clearing, light breeze</span></span>
<span>Lessons <span class="hand" style="font-size:18px;color:#1C4F6B">7 to 12</span></span>
</div>
<h3 class="display log-title" style="margin:18px 0 0;font-size:28px;line-height:1.15">Draw Your Other Map</h3>
<p style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#2E3842">Then, look at where you might want to go. What matters to you, what gives you energy, the possibilities you dismissed and the wishes you buried under “shoulds”. You don't need to settle on a grand destination. Just on what feels worth moving toward.</p>
<p class="hand" style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;color:#8A5129">Spotted land I'd stopped looking for.</p>
<p style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#4A5560">[Lesson titles 7–12, TBD]</p>
</div>

<div data-show="3" hidden>
<div class="log-head" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:4px 18px;margin-top:14px;font-size:13px;color:#4A5560;line-height:1.5">
<span>Position <span class="hand" style="font-size:18px;color:#1C4F6B">N 03°</span></span>
<span>Weather <span class="hand" style="font-size:18px;color:#1C4F6B">changeable, as always</span></span>
<span>Lessons <span class="hand" style="font-size:18px;color:#1C4F6B">13 to 15</span></span>
</div>
<h3 class="display log-title" style="margin:18px 0 0;font-size:28px;line-height:1.15">Stormproof Your Vessel</h3>
<p style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#2E3842">Finally, turn insight into movement. Gather what you already have, look the obstacles in the eye, and make a plan that belongs to you, not to some imaginary person who wakes up at 5 a.m. and enjoys cold showers. Then find ways to keep moving when motivation goes missing or the weather changes. Because it will. That's not a character flaw. That's life.</p>
<p class="hand" style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;color:#8A5129">Small steps. Still moving.</p>
<p style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#4A5560">[Lesson titles 13–15, TBD]</p>
</div>
