<!-- FAQ -->
<section aria-labelledby="faq-h" style="max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:90px 24px 0">
<p style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A5129;font-weight:600;text-align:center">Questions people ask before they set sail</p>
<h2 id="faq-h" class="display" style="margin:0 0 28px;font-size:clamp(34px,3.4vw,50px);line-height:1.1;text-align:center">Fair questions</h2>
<details open style="border-top:1px solid #D9C7AC;padding:18px 4px">
<summary class="display" style="cursor:pointer;font-size:24px;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center">When does it start, and what happens until then?</summary>
<p style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#3E4852">We set sail on Sunday, 3 January 2027, when your first lesson arrives. Until then you're not left waiting: Find Your Bearings is yours straight away, and I'll write to you a couple of times in December so you can get ready. [What exactly arrives in December, TBD]</p>
</details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #D9C7AC;padding:18px 4px">
<summary class="display" style="cursor:pointer;font-size:24px;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center">What if I join after 3 January?</summary>
<p style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#3E4852">You start right away, at your own pace. The launch price ends on 3 January; after that the journey costs £69.</p>
</details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #D9C7AC;padding:18px 4px">
<summary class="display" style="cursor:pointer;font-size:24px;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center">Is this a group programme?</summary>
<p style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#3E4852">No. A life reset is an inner, personal journey, and this one is yours alone. You won't be compared with anyone or asked to share. It's you, the lessons, and me writing to you along the way.</p>
</details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #D9C7AC;padding:18px 4px">
<summary class="display" style="cursor:pointer;font-size:24px;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center">What if I don't have a specific goal?</summary>
<p style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#3E4852">Then nothing. Honestly. You don't have to turn up saying “Sophie, here's my life, please make it into a SMART goal.” Part of the point is finding out what actually matters to you right now. You might end up with one clear goal. You might let go of three. You might find out an old goal is still yours after all. None of these is a bad result.</p>
</details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #D9C7AC;padding:18px 4px">
<summary class="display" style="cursor:pointer;font-size:24px;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center">I've already done a lot of self-development. Is this for me?</summary>
<p style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#3E4852">Then you probably won't discover a new planet in every exercise. I won't promise that either. But self-knowledge is a bit like cooking: the same ingredients turn into a completely different dish depending on who's cooking, in what order, and what they do with the three things that fell onto the counter halfway through.</p>
</details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #D9C7AC;padding:18px 4px">
<summary class="display" style="cursor:pointer;font-size:24px;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center">How much time does it take?</summary>
<p style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#3E4852">A lesson lands every two days, about four weeks in all. [Time per lesson, TBD]. You can go slower. The point isn't to finish fast, it's that something happens along the way.</p>
</details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #D9C7AC;padding:18px 4px">
<summary class="display" style="cursor:pointer;font-size:24px;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center">What if I fall behind?</summary>
<p style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#3E4852">You can't, really. There's no race, and nobody to fall behind. The lessons wait in your inbox, the workbook waits too, and you can leave more time between two parts whenever you need it.</p>
</details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #D9C7AC;border-bottom:1px solid #D9C7AC;padding:18px 4px">
<summary class="display" style="cursor:pointer;font-size:24px;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center">Can I get a refund?</summary>
<p style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#3E4852">Yes. Your statutory rights apply in full, including the 14-day right to cancel under UK consumer law. Details are in the <a href="#legal">Refund policy</a>. [Final wording to match the Merchant of Record's terms]</p>
</details>
</section>

<!-- 8 WHAT THIS ISN'T -->
<section style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:90px 24px 40px;text-align:center">
<p class="hand" style="margin:0;font-size:26px;color:#8A5129">A few things before we set sail</p>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:12px;margin-top:22px">
<span style="border:1.5px dashed #8A8F96;border-radius:999px;padding:10px 18px;font-size:16px;color:#3E4852">Not therapy</span>
<span style="border:1.5px dashed #8A8F96;border-radius:999px;padding:10px 18px;font-size:16px;color:#3E4852">Not a diagnosis</span>
<span style="border:1.5px dashed #8A8F96;border-radius:999px;padding:10px 18px;font-size:16px;color:#3E4852">Not a personality makeover</span>
<span style="border:1.5px dashed #8A8F96;border-radius:999px;padding:10px 18px;font-size:16px;color:#3E4852">Not “the one true purpose”</span>
<span style="border:1.5px dashed #8A8F96;border-radius:999px;padding:10px 18px;font-size:16px;color:#3E4852">Not a “better version of you” project</span>
</div>
<p class="display" style="margin:34px 0 0;font-size:clamp(26px,2.6vw,36px);line-height:1.3">You bring your life. I bring a map and a few pencils.<br><em style="color:#1C4F6B">The drawing is yours.</em></p>
